w_m6nis_2e␀They're trying to box us in.  Grab cover!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m6conv_3a␀␀We need to find another way into the compound.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m6conv_3b␀␀Looks that way.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m6conv_4a␀␀Hey, check out these relics.␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m6conv_4b␀␀Definitely old school.  And the markings...these belong to the Russian Air Force.  At least they used to.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m6conv_4c␀␀How'd they end up here?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m6conv_4d␀␀Good question.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m6conv_4e␀␀Should we light them up, Boss?  Not that there's much point, I mean-␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m6conv_4f␀␀Yeah, set charges.  We leave nothing behind.␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m6conv_5a␀␀Anything good?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m6conv_5b␀␀Not really.  Bunch of invoices, maintenance logs...Hang on.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m6conv_5c␀␀Whatchya got?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m6conv_5d␀␀Service charts with maps printed on the back.  Shows the entire compound, access tunnels, the whole nine yards.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m6conv_5e␀␀Nice work.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m6conv_6a␀␀This path looks like it leads to the main generator.␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m6conv_6b␀␀You get me inside, I'll put that generator out of commission.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m6conv_6c␀␀Hell yeah!  Let's send these guys back to the dark ages.␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m6conv_7a␀␀They've got gun emplacements down there.  We might want to find another way around.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m6conv_7b␀␀Damn, why's the shortest route always the hardest?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m6conv_7c␀␀Way of the world, man.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m6nis_3a␀Alright, we don't have much time.  RAVEN, get to work disabling the generator, and while you're at it, see if you can do something about this alarm.  TORO, give him a hand.  SANDMAN and I will cover the entryway.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
s_m6nis_3b␀I got tangos.  Three...make that four -␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m6nis_3c␀I got'em!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m6nis_3d␀On your left!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
s_m6nis_3e␀I see him.␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m6nis_3f␀Where are we with that generator?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
r_m6nis_3g␀Almost there.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m6nis_3h␀Well, hurry up!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
r_m6nis_3i␀Okay.  Got it!␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m6conv_8a␀␀Alright, let's move.  Our night vision should give us the advantage through these tunnels.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m6conv_9a␀␀We use our night vision goggles, it'll be like shooting fish in a barrel.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m6conv_9b␀␀Switching to night vision.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m6conv_9c␀␀I can't see a damn thing.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m6conv_9d␀␀Put on your night vision goggles.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m6conv_10a␀Heads up!  APC inbound!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m6conv_10b␀Watch your step...it's got a gun turret.␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m6conv_10c␀They're running scared.  Keep on them.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m6conv_10d␀She can't take much more of this.  Let's finish her off.␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m6conv_10e␀Good work!  Now let's get to the control room.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m6conv_11a␀We need to get to that control room and shut down the comms.␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m6conv_11b␀How are they still broadcasting on that damn P.A. system?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m6conv_11c␀I don't know, but they're using it to funnel their forces toward our position.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m6conv_11d␀We get to that control room, I'm gonna shove that microphone down someone's throat.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ku3_m6nis_4a␀Don't shoot!␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m6nis_4b␀Cover him.␀␀␀␀␀␀
r_m6nis_4c␀You got anything worth telling us, do it quick. You're gonna talk, it's just a question of how much you want to suffer first.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ku3_m6nis_4d␀No...no, please!  I'll talk.␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m6nis_4e␀We're listening.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ku3_m6nis_4f␀It's Gozorov you want, not me!  Please!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m6nis_4g␀Vasyli Gozorov? What does he have to do with the KRA?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ku3_m6nis_4h␀He's the one who gives the orders...him and his contacts in the Russian military, the ones who help supply us with weapons, transport...cash.␀␀␀␀␀p␀␀
s_m6nis_4i␀I think it's time we track down Gozorov...pay him a visit.␀␀␀␀␀␀
